WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.462
Let’s walk through Session Timeline.

00:00:02.462 --> 00:00:05.675
Use filters to reconstruct the run across state changes,

00:00:05.675 --> 00:00:09.025
artifacts, RFIs, communications, captures, and seat

00:00:09.025 --> 00:00:10.162
activity.

00:00:10.162 --> 00:00:12.850
Verify sequence here, then return to the owning record

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:14.900
for its current authoritative state.

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:18.325
On this slide, audit actions, RFIs, communications

00:00:18.325 --> 00:00:21.587
, captures, seat changes, and game-state events.

00:00:21.587 --> 00:00:24.850
In practice, use filters to reconstruct the run and

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:28.413
verify sequence before export or after-action review.

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:31.960
When you are ready, use Open Session Timeline to

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:33.760
move to the live surface.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:36.460
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:36.610
.
